<p>The way that it's written now makes it sound like the ritual is different each time. So yes, there's a horrible Satan-devil ritual that kills the character, but how the fuck am I supposed to know which one is actually a trigger ritual and which is just a disturbing imagination. And yes, their names match, but that still doesn't address <em>how they found the kid so fast</em>. I work for a government bureacracy working with medical records for a living; even <em>if</em> the kid was A) born in a medical facility that B) issued and filed birth certificates, those typically don't actually get registered for between 10 days and a month. If the kid <em>wasn't</em> born in a hospital that issued birth certificates (home birth, anyone? they're becoming increasingly popular in the USA) then it'll take <em>even longer</em> to find the kid.</p>
